{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"\"Baeshra want tell. Why Baeshra find new tribe. Why Baeshra not with old tribe.\"  She takes a deep breath before slowly try lean up. \"Baeshra leave old tribe for missed steak. Baeshra no want hide thing any more. All tribe know how Baeshra hunt. How Baeshra fight. Not all Baeshra old tribe tribe hunt same. Only Baeshra. Long time. Many old tribe fight spears, bows all make from hunts. Baeshra much pride. Baeshra hunt like apex. Use teeth. Use claws. Sneak. Only Baeshra hunt like Baeshra. Many old tribe no like, think wrong, to savage. Some Elders think more honor for Baeshra. Fight with less hunt more. One day...\" she takes a pause.","created_at":"2020-08-04T04:34:54.429000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740065204204863540","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
