{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055402120904784","content":"\"One day... Baeshra on hunt.  No find thing to hunt. Stop. Listen. Much wait. Soon. Bushes move. Some thing come. Baeshra strike. Baeshra kill... but... no prey... Baeshra kill youngling. Subeak... mean Small Hunter...\" She looks to Wren with tears in her eyes. \"Subeak... more young then Wren...\" Baeshra let's out a shaky breath before continuing. \"Baeshra bring Subeak back to tribe. Lose much honor, kill tribe bad... much much bad. Baeshra learn Subeak much like Baeshra, learn from Baeshra, hunt like Baeshra. Subeak no tell Baeshra... Baeshra no know... Subeak good.. much good... Baeshra tribe no want...\" she pauses to think of the word she learned so long ago in London. \"Murderer... Baeshra leave old tribe... Baeshra know Baeshra did much bad...\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T04:45:10.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740067788491849811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
